  <diagram id="workflow" name="Neoantimon2-Converters — external prediction with traceable origins">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="8" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="760" figureTitle="Neoantimon2-Converters — external prediction with traceable origins" figureDescription="A completed Neoantimon2 project exports unique peptides and peptide-HLA queries with all origin annotations. The user separately runs binding-affinity, presentation or immunogenicity models. Nine pinned format adapters across eight families convert native outputs to the standard TSV. Strict import into the original completed project preserves every origin and native results; external rankings and explanations are separate. Converter/import tests used schema-faithful synthetic fixtures, not upstream predictor execution.">
