        <mxCell id="bounds-body" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Adapters do not run engines or bundle binaries / weights. Review scripts and authorize execution.&#10;BA, EL and IM scales differ. Raw IM scores are not EL percentiles and do not imply somatic A–E grades.&#10;Native evidence, grades and ranks remain unchanged. Every matched candidate keeps all original Origin links." style="shape=text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#233746;spacing=0;">
